  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your body consists of incredibly hard, but fragile, living crystal; like diamond, quartz, sapphire and so on.</p><ul><li><strong>Arms:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.mDgEMOoJpi8DkRYb]{Magical}, @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.wMwSRDmgiF2IdCJr]{Painless}, @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.3wCtgMDNnu8MFmyk]{Immunity} (Fire), -5 Agility, +5 Toughness, -1 Wound per arm, +4 AP, +40% weight. Critical hit result of 71+ shatters the body part.</li><li><strong>Legs:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.mDgEMOoJpi8DkRYb]{Magical}, @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.wMwSRDmgiF2IdCJr]{Painless}, @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.3wCtgMDNnu8MFmyk]{Immunity} (Fire), -5 Agility, +5 Toughness, -1 Wound per leg, +4 AP, +120% weight. Critical hit result of 71+ shatters the body part.</li><li><strong>Body:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.mDgEMOoJpi8DkRYb]{Magical}, @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.wMwSRDmgiF2IdCJr]{Painless}, @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.3wCtgMDNnu8MFmyk]{Immunity} (Fire), +10 Toughness, -5 Agility, -2 Wounds, +4 AP, +200% weight. Critical hit result of 71+ shatters the body, causing immediate death.</li><li><strong>Head:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.mDgEMOoJpi8DkRYb]{Magical}, @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.wMwSRDmgiF2IdCJr]{Painless}, @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.3wCtgMDNnu8MFmyk]{Immunity} (Fire), +4 AP, -5 Initiative, -1 Wound, +40% weight. Critical hit result of 71+ shatters the head, causing immediate death.</li></ul>"
